  "title": {
   "en": "Hanmen Kyoushi ~Seito no Tame nara, Nandemo Yarimasu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "犯面教師～生徒のためなら、何でもヤリます～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Criminal Teacher: I'll Do Anything for My Students"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Cô Giáo Tội Phạm"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I'll do anything for the students.\" Beautiful teacher Mina was newly assigned to a problematic class where teacher bullying was rampant behind the scenes. The troublemakers quickly set their sights on Mina, but the students didn't know... she was a dedicated teacher who would go to extreme lengths for her students' sake. As Mina resolves various issues through unconventional methods, the students are taken aback, reconsider their actions, and gradually reform. Here emerges a true example of an unusual educator.",
   "ja": "「生徒のためなら…何でもヤリます。」美人教師の美奈が新しく赴任したのは、裏で先生イジメがはびこる問題クラスだった。すぐさま美奈にも魔の手が伸びるが、生徒達は知らなかった…彼女は生徒のためなら法をも犯す、サイコなビッチ教師だということを。どんな問題もイカれた方法で解決していく美奈に、生徒達はドン引きし我に返って更生してゆき…。真の反面教師、ここに爆誕。",
   "vi": "\"Vì học sinh, cô sẵn sàng làm bất kỳ chuyện gì\" - Hakanai Mina. Và cô ấy thật sự làm đúng như những gì mình nói."
  },
